    narr:narration """The trajectory of this hub centers on the operationalization of [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), a core differentiator defined in early 2026. By July 2026, the focus shifted toward validating this mechanism through [sprint delivery evidence](narr:Position_SprintDeliveryEvidenceQuantified). Recent updates from the team owner highlight the [shipping of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_1) as a concrete milestone, supported by [velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_2) and the identification of the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_3) as the primary technical unlock for this capability.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_SprintDeliveryEvidenceQuantified> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "decision capture at the point of consensus" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Velocity was 23 points, highest this quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tension exists between the qualitative goal of 'decision capture' and the quantitative framing of 'sprint velocity' as the primary evidence of success." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_SprintDeliveryEvidenceQuantified> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785493054982_2> ] ;
